      "uid": "zhcn:bbdaef2053007dbd43739540",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她获胜瞬间的记忆立刻苏醒。\n那时我的脑子里都是下一步的事\n……但稍后，心中燃起了一把火――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2321909eb596ad10f3b85901da9e98fe8f997ff7e858d4a3b6d0bc8e65f2be8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
