    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:739529cc6c38833d94bf139d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时至今日，我们积累的每一次对话，\n一起奋斗的每一天……\n眼花缭乱地、飞快地闪过脑海――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49a6eb92fb3fefff8e7b52c7e5941995ee50537cab9644f15d23d23bec714d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
